{"seq":2,"slug":"thread-core-ideas","title":"线程的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/threads/thread-core-ideas","wordCount":1312,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"线程的核心思想\">线程的核心思想</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>线程模型的设计思想可以归纳为三条：<strong>轻量级并发</strong>、<strong>并行执行</strong>与<strong>资源共享</strong>。它们分别对应线程的&quot;低成本&quot;、&quot;高算力&quot;与&quot;高效率通信&quot;三个优势，也各自带来了相应的代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>轻量级并发</strong></td>\n<td>低开销的并发执行</td>\n<td>故障隔离弱，线程崩溃可能导致进程终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>并行执行</strong></td>\n<td>充分利用多核性能</td>\n<td>受阿姆达尔定律中串行比例限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>资源共享</strong></td>\n<td>高效的线程间通信</td>\n<td>竞态条件风险，必须正确使用同步机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[&quot;线程模型 Thread Model&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;轻量级并发&lt;br/&gt;共享进程资源,开销低&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; P[&quot;并行执行&lt;br/&gt;利用多核,提升算力&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; S[&quot;资源共享&lt;br/&gt;共享地址空间,通信高效&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt;|使能| P&#10;  L --&gt;|代价| W[&quot;故障隔离弱&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt;|限制| A[&quot;受阿姆达尔定律约束&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|代价| R[&quot;竞态条件,需要同步机制&quot;]\">graph TD\n  T[\"线程模型 Thread Model\"] --&gt; L[\"轻量级并发&lt;br/&gt;共享进程资源,开销低\"]\n  T --&gt; P[\"并行执行&lt;br/&gt;利用多核,提升算力\"]\n  T --&gt; S[\"资源共享&lt;br/&gt;共享地址空间,通信高效\"]\n  L --&gt;|使能| P\n  L --&gt;|代价| W[\"故障隔离弱\"]\n  P --&gt;|限制| A[\"受阿姆达尔定律约束\"]\n  S --&gt;|代价| R[\"竞态条件,需要同步机制\"]</pre><p>三者环环相扣：轻量让并行成为可能，共享让通信变高效，但共享同时把&quot;数据一致性&quot;问题引入了进来——这正是锁、信号量等同步机制存在的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轻量级并发-共享进程资源\">轻量级并发——共享进程资源</h2><p>线程最核心的设计思想是<strong>轻量级并发</strong>。与进程不同，线程不需要独立的地址空间和资源副本，而是<strong>共享所属进程的全部资源</strong>。这使得线程的创建、销毁和切换开销远小于进程，从而实现更高效的并发执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph MultiProcess[&quot;Multi-Process Model&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        P1[&quot;Process A&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Independent Resources&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;Process B&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Independent Resources&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;Process C&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Independent Resources&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph MultiThread[&quot;Multi-Thread Model&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        SHARED[&quot;Shared Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Shared Resources&quot;]&#10;        TA[&quot;Thread A&lt;br/&gt;Stack + PC&quot;]&#10;        TB[&quot;Thread B&lt;br/&gt;Stack + PC&quot;]&#10;        TC[&quot;Thread C&lt;br/&gt;Stack + PC&quot;]&#10;        SHARED --- TA&#10;        SHARED --- TB&#10;        SHARED --- TC&#10;    end&#10;    MultiProcess --&gt;|&quot;High Resource Consumption&lt;br/&gt;High Context Switch Overhead&quot;| NOTE1[&quot;Independent&quot;]&#10;    MultiThread --&gt;|&quot;Low Resource Consumption&lt;br/&gt;Low Context Switch Overhead&quot;| NOTE2[&quot;Shared Collaboration&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph MultiProcess[\"Multi-Process Model\"]\n        direction TB\n        P1[\"Process A&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Independent Resources\"]\n        P2[\"Process B&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Independent Resources\"]\n        P3[\"Process C&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Independent Resources\"]\n    end\n    subgraph MultiThread[\"Multi-Thread Model\"]\n        direction TB\n        SHARED[\"Shared Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Shared Resources\"]\n        TA[\"Thread A&lt;br/&gt;Stack + PC\"]\n        TB[\"Thread B&lt;br/&gt;Stack + PC\"]\n        TC[\"Thread C&lt;br/&gt;Stack + PC\"]\n        SHARED --- TA\n        SHARED --- TB\n        SHARED --- TC\n    end\n    MultiProcess --&gt;|\"High Resource Consumption&lt;br/&gt;High Context Switch Overhead\"| NOTE1[\"Independent\"]\n    MultiThread --&gt;|\"Low Resource Consumption&lt;br/&gt;Low Context Switch Overhead\"| NOTE2[\"Shared Collaboration\"]</pre><h3 id=\"开销对比\">开销对比</h3><p>创建一个新进程和创建一个新线程的开销差异是巨大的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>进程</th>\n<th>线程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>创建</strong></td>\n<td>需要分配独立地址空间、页表、文件描述符表等</td>\n<td>只需分配栈空间和少量线程控制信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>销毁</strong></td>\n<td>需要回收全部独立资源</td>\n<td>只需回收栈和线程控制块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>上下文切换</strong></td>\n<td>需要切换页表、刷新 TLB、切换寄存器</td>\n<td>只需切换寄存器和栈指针（同进程内）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>内存占用</strong></td>\n<td>每个进程独立占用完整地址空间</td>\n<td>多个线程共享同一地址空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 多进程方案：每个任务一个进程&#10;FUNCTION multi_process_approach(tasks):&#10;    FOR EACH task IN tasks:&#10;        pid = fork()                    // 开销大：复制整个地址空间&#10;        IF pid == 0 THEN&#10;            execute(task)&#10;            exit(0)&#10;        END IF&#10;    END FOR&#10;    wait_all()&#10;&#10;// 多线程方案：每个任务一个线程&#10;FUNCTION multi_thread_approach(tasks):&#10;    threads = []&#10;    FOR EACH task IN tasks:&#10;        t = create_thread(execute, task) // 开销小：只分配栈&#10;        threads.append(t)&#10;    END FOR&#10;    join_all(threads)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 多进程方案：每个任务一个进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION multi_process_approach(tasks):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FOR EACH task IN tasks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pid = fork()                    // 开销大：复制整个地址空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IF pid == 0 THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            execute(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            exit(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        END IF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END FOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait_all()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 多线程方案：每个任务一个线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION multi_thread_approach(tasks):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    threads = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FOR EACH task IN tasks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        t = create_thread(execute, task) // 开销小：只分配栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        threads.append(t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    END FOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    join_all(threads)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么轻量很重要\">为什么轻量很重要</h3><p>在高并发场景下，线程的轻量特性直接影响系统的可扩展性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"场景：Web 服务器同时处理 1000 个请求&#10;&#10;多进程方案：&#10;  - 创建 1000 个进程&#10;  - 每个进程约占 10MB 独立内存 → 总计 ~10GB&#10;  - 进程切换需要刷新 TLB → 切换慢&#10;  - 系统负载高，响应延迟大&#10;&#10;多线程方案：&#10;  - 创建 1000 个线程&#10;  - 每个线程约占 1MB 栈空间 → 总计 ~1GB&#10;  - 同进程线程切换无需刷新 TLB → 切换快&#10;  - 系统负载低，响应延迟小\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>场景：Web 服务器同时处理 1000 个请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>多进程方案：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 创建 1000 个进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 每个进程约占 10MB 独立内存 → 总计 ~10GB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 进程切换需要刷新 TLB → 切换慢</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 系统负载高，响应延迟大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>多线程方案：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 创建 1000 个线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 每个线程约占 1MB 栈空间 → 总计 ~1GB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 同进程线程切换无需刷新 TLB → 切换快</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 系统负载低，响应延迟小</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并行执行-充分利用多核\">并行执行——充分利用多核</h2><p>线程的第二个核心思想是<strong>并行执行</strong>。在多核处理器上，同一进程内的多个线程可以被分配到不同的 CPU 核心上<strong>真正同时执行</strong>，从而成倍提升计算能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph SingleThread[&quot;Single-Thread Execution&quot;]&#10;        direction LR&#10;        ST1[&quot;Task 1&quot;] --&gt; ST2[&quot;Task 2&quot;] --&gt; ST3[&quot;Task 3&quot;] --&gt; ST4[&quot;Task 4&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph MultiThread2[&quot;Multi-Thread Parallel Execution&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        C1[&quot;Core 1: Thread A → Task 1, Task 3&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;Core 2: Thread B → Task 2, Task 4&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    SingleThread --&gt;|&quot;Total Time = T1+T2+T3+T4&quot;| R1[&quot;Long Serial Duration&quot;]&#10;    MultiThread2 --&gt;|&quot;Total Time ≈ (T1+T2)/2&quot;| R2[&quot;Short Parallel Duration&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph SingleThread[\"Single-Thread Execution\"]\n        direction LR\n        ST1[\"Task 1\"] --&gt; ST2[\"Task 2\"] --&gt; ST3[\"Task 3\"] --&gt; ST4[\"Task 4\"]\n    end\n    subgraph MultiThread2[\"Multi-Thread Parallel Execution\"]\n        direction TB\n        C1[\"Core 1: Thread A → Task 1, Task 3\"]\n        C2[\"Core 2: Thread B → Task 2, Task 4\"]\n    end\n    SingleThread --&gt;|\"Total Time = T1+T2+T3+T4\"| R1[\"Long Serial Duration\"]\n    MultiThread2 --&gt;|\"Total Time ≈ (T1+T2)/2\"| R2[\"Short Parallel Duration\"]</pre><h3 id=\"并行加速的理论极限\">并行加速的理论极限</h3><p>并行加速并非无限——**阿姆达尔定律（Amdahl&#39;s Law）**指出，程序中必须串行执行的部分限制了整体加速比的上限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"加速比 S = 1 / (s + (1-s)/N)&#10;&#10;其中：&#10;  s = 程序中串行部分的比例&#10;  N = 处理器核心数&#10;&#10;示例：&#10;  若程序有 10% 必须串行 (s = 0.1)：&#10;    2 核加速比 = 1 / (0.1 + 0.9/2)  = 1.82x&#10;    4 核加速比 = 1 / (0.1 + 0.9/4)  = 3.08x&#10;    8 核加速比 = 1 / (0.1 + 0.9/8)  = 4.71x&#10;    ∞ 核加速比 = 1 / 0.1            = 10x（理论极限）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>加速比 S = 1 / (s + (1-s)/N)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>其中：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  s = 程序中串行部分的比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  N = 处理器核心数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  若程序有 10% 必须串行 (s = 0.1)：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2 核加速比 = 1 / (0.1 + 0.9/2)  = 1.82x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    4 核加速比 = 1 / (0.1 + 0.9/4)  = 3.08x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    8 核加速比 = 1 / (0.1 + 0.9/8)  = 4.71x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ∞ 核加速比 = 1 / 0.1            = 10x（理论极限）</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>串行比例</th>\n<th>2 核加速比</th>\n<th>4 核加速比</th>\n<th>8 核加速比</th>\n<th>理论极限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>1.90x</td>\n<td>3.48x</td>\n<td>5.93x</td>\n<td>20x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>1.82x</td>\n<td>3.08x</td>\n<td>4.71x</td>\n<td>10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>1.60x</td>\n<td>2.29x</td>\n<td>2.91x</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>1.33x</td>\n<td>1.60x</td>\n<td>1.78x</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    TASK[&quot;Parallelizable Task&quot;]&#10;    TASK --&gt; ANA{&quot;Analyze Serial Proportion&quot;}&#10;    ANA --&gt;|&quot;Low Serial Proportion&quot;| GOOD[&quot;High Multi-Thread Benefit&lt;br/&gt;Worth Parallelizing&quot;]&#10;    ANA --&gt;|&quot;High Serial Proportion&quot;| BAD[&quot;Limited Multi-Thread Benefit&lt;br/&gt;Prioritize Optimizing Serial Part&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    TASK[\"Parallelizable Task\"]\n    TASK --&gt; ANA{\"Analyze Serial Proportion\"}\n    ANA --&gt;|\"Low Serial Proportion\"| GOOD[\"High Multi-Thread Benefit&lt;br/&gt;Worth Parallelizing\"]\n    ANA --&gt;|\"High Serial Proportion\"| BAD[\"Limited Multi-Thread Benefit&lt;br/&gt;Prioritize Optimizing Serial Part\"]</pre><h3 id=\"适合并行的任务类型\">适合并行的任务类型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"✓ 适合多线程并行：&#10;  - CPU 密集型计算（图像处理、数据分析、矩阵运算）&#10;  - 可独立分割的批处理任务&#10;  - 互不依赖的 I/O 请求&#10;&#10;✗ 不适合多线程并行：&#10;  - 高度依赖前序结果的串行计算&#10;  - 数据依赖紧密、需要频繁同步的任务&#10;  - 单步计算量极小但步骤极多的流水线\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>✓ 适合多线程并行：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - CPU 密集型计算（图像处理、数据分析、矩阵运算）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 可独立分割的批处理任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 互不依赖的 I/O 请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✗ 不适合多线程并行：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 高度依赖前序结果的串行计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 数据依赖紧密、需要频繁同步的任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 单步计算量极小但步骤极多的流水线</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"资源共享-降低通信成本\">资源共享——降低通信成本</h2><p>线程的第三个核心思想是<strong>资源共享</strong>。由于同一进程内的线程共享地址空间，线程间的数据交换无需通过操作系统中转，可以直接读写共享变量，通信效率远高于进程间通信（IPC）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph InterProcessComm[&quot;Inter-Process Communication (IPC)&quot;]&#10;        direction LR&#10;        PA[&quot;Process A&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&quot;]&#10;        IPC[&quot;OS Kernel&lt;br/&gt;Pipe / Message Queue / Shared Memory&quot;]&#10;        PB[&quot;Process B&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space&quot;]&#10;        PA --&gt;|&quot;① Write to Kernel Buffer&quot;| IPC&#10;        IPC --&gt;|&quot;② Copy from Kernel to Process B&quot;| PB&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph InterThreadComm[&quot;Inter-Thread Communication&quot;]&#10;        direction LR&#10;        TA[&quot;Thread A&quot;]&#10;        SMEM[&quot;Shared Variable&lt;br/&gt;(Same Address Space)&quot;]&#10;        TBB[&quot;Thread B&quot;]&#10;        TA --&gt;|&quot;Direct Write&quot;| SMEM&#10;        SMEM --&gt;|&quot;Direct Read&quot;| TBB&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph InterProcessComm[\"Inter-Process Communication (IPC)\"]\n        direction LR\n        PA[\"Process A&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space\"]\n        IPC[\"OS Kernel&lt;br/&gt;Pipe / Message Queue / Shared Memory\"]\n        PB[\"Process B&lt;br/&gt;Independent Address Space\"]\n        PA --&gt;|\"① Write to Kernel Buffer\"| IPC\n        IPC --&gt;|\"② Copy from Kernel to Process B\"| PB\n    end\n    subgraph InterThreadComm[\"Inter-Thread Communication\"]\n        direction LR\n        TA[\"Thread A\"]\n        SMEM[\"Shared Variable&lt;br/&gt;(Same Address Space)\"]\n        TBB[\"Thread B\"]\n        TA --&gt;|\"Direct Write\"| SMEM\n        SMEM --&gt;|\"Direct Read\"| TBB\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"通信效率对比\">通信效率对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通信方式</th>\n<th>数据拷贝次数</th>\n<th>是否需要内核介入</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>编程复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>管道（IPC）</strong></td>\n<td>2 次（用户→内核→用户）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>消息队列（IPC）</strong></td>\n<td>2 次</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>共享内存（IPC）</strong></td>\n<td>0 次（但需显式设置）</td>\n<td>初始设置时需要</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>线程共享变量</strong></td>\n<td>0 次（天然共享）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><strong>最快</strong></td>\n<td>中（需同步）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"let sharedCounter = 0;&#10;&#10;function incrementByThreadA(): void {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {&#10;    sharedCounter++;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function readByThreadB(): number {&#10;  return sharedCounter;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sharedCounter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> incrementByThreadA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sharedCounter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readByThreadB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sharedCounter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"共享的代价-同步问题\">共享的代价——同步问题</h3><p>资源共享虽然提高了通信效率，但也引入了<strong>数据一致性</strong>问题。当多个线程同时读写共享数据时，如果没有适当的同步机制，就会出现<strong>竞态条件（Race Condition）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 竞态条件示例&#10;shared_variable counter = 0&#10;&#10;THREAD_A:&#10;    temp = counter      // 读取：temp = 0&#10;    temp = temp + 1     // 计算：temp = 1&#10;    counter = temp      // 写回：counter = 1&#10;&#10;THREAD_B:               // 与线程 A 同时执行！&#10;    temp = counter      // 读取：temp = 0（还没看到线程 A 的写入）&#10;    temp = temp + 1     // 计算：temp = 1&#10;    counter = temp      // 写回：counter = 1&#10;&#10;// 预期结果：counter = 2&#10;// 实际结果：counter = 1（丢失了一次更新！）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 竞态条件示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>shared_variable counter = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>THREAD_A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = counter      // 读取：temp = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = temp + 1     // 计算：temp = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    counter = temp      // 写回：counter = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>THREAD_B:               // 与线程 A 同时执行！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = counter      // 读取：temp = 0（还没看到线程 A 的写入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    temp = temp + 1     // 计算：temp = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    counter = temp      // 写回：counter = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 预期结果：counter = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 实际结果：counter = 1（丢失了一次更新！）</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SHARE[&quot;Thread Shared Resources&quot;]&#10;    SHARE --&gt; FAST[&quot;High Communication Efficiency&lt;br/&gt;No Kernel Relay Needed&quot;]&#10;    SHARE --&gt; RISK[&quot;Data Consistency Risk&lt;br/&gt;Race Condition&quot;]&#10;    RISK --&gt; SYNC[&quot;Synchronization Mechanism Needed&quot;]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; LOCK[&quot;Lock (Mutex)&quot;]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; SEM[&quot;Semaphore&quot;]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; COND[&quot;Condition Variable&quot;]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; ATOMIC[&quot;Atomic Operation&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    SHARE[\"Thread Shared Resources\"]\n    SHARE --&gt; FAST[\"High Communication Efficiency&lt;br/&gt;No Kernel Relay Needed\"]\n    SHARE --&gt; RISK[\"Data Consistency Risk&lt;br/&gt;Race Condition\"]\n    RISK --&gt; SYNC[\"Synchronization Mechanism Needed\"]\n    SYNC --&gt; LOCK[\"Lock (Mutex)\"]\n    SYNC --&gt; SEM[\"Semaphore\"]\n    SYNC --&gt; COND[\"Condition Variable\"]\n    SYNC --&gt; ATOMIC[\"Atomic Operation\"]</pre><h2 id=\"三大核心思想的关系\">三大核心思想的关系</h2><p>轻量级并发、并行执行和资源共享这三大核心思想构成了线程模型的完整图景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    T[&quot;Thread Model&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; L[&quot;Lightweight Concurrency&lt;br/&gt;Shared Process Resources&lt;br/&gt;Low Overhead&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; P[&quot;Parallel Execution&lt;br/&gt;Utilize Multi-Core&lt;br/&gt;Improve Computing Power&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; S[&quot;Resource Sharing&lt;br/&gt;Shared Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Efficient Communication&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;Enables&quot;| P&#10;    S --&gt;|&quot;Cost&quot;| SYNC[&quot;Synchronization Mechanism Needed&lt;br/&gt;Prevent Race Conditions&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt;|&quot;Limitation&quot;| AMDAHL[&quot;Constrained by Amdahl&#39;s Law&lt;br/&gt;Serial Part Is the Bottleneck&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;Cost&quot;| WEAK[&quot;Weak Fault Isolation&lt;br/&gt;One Thread Crash Affects Entire Process&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    T[\"Thread Model\"]\n    T --&gt; L[\"Lightweight Concurrency&lt;br/&gt;Shared Process Resources&lt;br/&gt;Low Overhead\"]\n    T --&gt; P[\"Parallel Execution&lt;br/&gt;Utilize Multi-Core&lt;br/&gt;Improve Computing Power\"]\n    T --&gt; S[\"Resource Sharing&lt;br/&gt;Shared Address Space&lt;br/&gt;Efficient Communication\"]\n    L --&gt;|\"Enables\"| P\n    S --&gt;|\"Cost\"| SYNC[\"Synchronization Mechanism Needed&lt;br/&gt;Prevent Race Conditions\"]\n    P --&gt;|\"Limitation\"| AMDAHL[\"Constrained by Amdahl's Law&lt;br/&gt;Serial Part Is the Bottleneck\"]\n    L --&gt;|\"Cost\"| WEAK[\"Weak Fault Isolation&lt;br/&gt;One Thread Crash Affects Entire Process\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>关键考量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>轻量级并发</strong></td>\n<td>低开销的并发执行</td>\n<td>故障隔离弱</td>\n<td>线程崩溃可能导致进程终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>并行执行</strong></td>\n<td>充分利用多核性能</td>\n<td>受串行比例限制</td>\n<td>需评估任务的可并行性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>资源共享</strong></td>\n<td>高效的线程间通信</td>\n<td>竞态条件风险</td>\n<td>必须正确使用同步机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>轻量级并发</strong>是线程区别于进程的核心特征：线程共享进程的地址空间和资源，创建和切换开销远小于进程，使得高并发场景更加高效。</li>\n<li><strong>并行执行</strong>是多线程的关键收益：在多核处理器上，多个线程可以真正同时运行，但加速效果受限于阿姆达尔定律中程序的串行比例。</li>\n<li><strong>资源共享</strong>是线程间高效通信的基础：线程可直接读写共享变量而无需内核中转，但同时引入了竞态条件等数据一致性问题，必须通过同步机制来保障正确性。</li>\n<li>三大核心思想相互关联、相互制约——轻量使并行成为可能，共享使通信更高效，但也带来了同步复杂性和故障隔离弱的代价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线程的核心思想","id":"线程的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"轻量级并发——共享进程资源","id":"轻量级并发-共享进程资源"},{"level":3,"text":"开销对比","id":"开销对比"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么轻量很重要","id":"为什么轻量很重要"},{"level":2,"text":"并行执行——充分利用多核","id":"并行执行-充分利用多核"},{"level":3,"text":"并行加速的理论极限","id":"并行加速的理论极限"},{"level":3,"text":"适合并行的任务类型","id":"适合并行的任务类型"},{"level":2,"text":"资源共享——降低通信成本","id":"资源共享-降低通信成本"},{"level":3,"text":"通信效率对比","id":"通信效率对比"},{"level":3,"text":"共享的代价——同步问题","id":"共享的代价-同步问题"},{"level":2,"text":"三大核心思想的关系","id":"三大核心思想的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线程的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/threads/thread-definition-and-concepts"},"next":{"title":"线程的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/threads/thread-implementation"}}